    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are proud to present 4 Merton Hall, Mount Saint Annes, Milltown, Dublin 6 to the market. This impressive two-bedroom, two-bathroom ground-floor apartment is situated within the highly regarded and award-winning Mount Saint Annes development and is presented to the market in turnkey condition.\n\nExtending to approximately 73 sq. m., the apartment offers well-proportioned and thoughtfully laid-out accommodation throughout. The property briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright and spacious living room measuring approximately 3.53m x 3.41m, with a separate dining area measuring approximately 3.64m x 3.01m, providing an excellent space for both everyday living and entertaining.\n\nThe kitchen is positioned conveniently off the dining area and measures approximately 3.64m x 2.12m, offering ample scope for storage and preparation space. There are two well-proportioned bedrooms, with the principal bedroom measuring approximately 2.49m x 5.26m and benefiting from a private ensuite shower room. The second bedroom measures approximately 2.78m x 5.26m and is also generously proportioned. A main family bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nThe property benefits from its ground-floor position, excellent room proportions and a highly practical two-bedroom, two-bathroom layout. The accommodation is ideally suited to a wide variety of buyers, including first-time buyers, downsizers, investors and those seeking a comfortable home in a mature and established development.\n\nMount Saint Annes is renowned for its beautifully landscaped communal grounds, mature trees and attractive surroundings, creating a peaceful setting while remaining exceptionally well connected to Dublin city centre. The property is ideally located close to the amenities of Milltown, Ranelagh, Rathmines and Dundrum, with a superb selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and recreational facilities nearby. There are also excellent transport links, including the LUAS Green Line, providing convenient access to the city centre and beyond.\n\n4 Merton Hall represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment in one of Dublin 6's most sought-after developments. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
