        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 3.53m x 3.41m\n\n\nDining Area - 3.64m x 3.01m\n\n\nKitchen - 3.64m x 2.12m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.08m x 1.70m\n\n\nBedroom - 2.78m x 5.26m\n\n\nBedroom - 2.49m x 5.26m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.18m x 1.64m\n\n\n"
